Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 21:25:08 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] qwen35: kernel follow-ups for the drafter and verify

The drafter's attention with head_dim fixed at compile time, verify attention on shared K/V tiles, and Q4_K dequantized from one 16-byte load per piece.

Upstream: not offered, fork only
Retire-when: with patches 5 and 6
Carried-commits: b00831d 17a9818 2fefe5f
